            "review_title": "Review at Cà Phê Quang Lê",
            "review_text": "Hugo N\n1 contribution\n0\nA scam for tourists.\nFeb 2024 • Family\nVery nice view but the cafe is basically a scam.\n\nThey sell instant coffee instead of salted coffee (a Huê specialty that requires preparation.)\n\nThey do not put the prices on the menu which allows them to charge more expensive prices for foreigners. There was a moment of confusion when paying because the waitress didn't know what price the coffee was told to cost me. We paid 50% more for our “salty” coffee than in Huê to drink a low-end and very sweet instant coffee.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 19, 2024",
